title: The Roguelike template
intro: A crypt made anew every game, floor after floor, where everything moves when the hero moves. No code.
project: Roguelike | Crypt Crawl

chapter: The crypt | A dungeon, a hero and a HUD
scene: Crypt
say: The Roguelike template is a menu and this crypt, built from no-code pieces.
select: Crypt
explain: component:DungeonGenerator | Dungeon Generator | A Dungeon Generator lays out each floor: rooms and corridors of stone walls and flagstones. With a seed of zero, every game is a new crypt.
explain: field:DungeonGenerator.Spawns | Spawns | It scatters slimes, bats, potions and gold through the rooms, and puts the stairs in the furthest.
set: DungeonGenerator.Seed = 24
say: For this demo it gets seed 24, so the crypt is the same each time.
select: Player
explain: component:BumpAttack | Bump Attack | The hero steps a cell a turn and fights by walking into monsters.
explain: field:Inventory.ItemUses | Item Uses | Potions go in the inventory, and the one key drinks one.
select: Floor
explain: field:Counter.CountFloor | Count Floor | The HUD shows the floor, and keeps the deepest for the menu.
select: Game Over
explain: field:Panel.OpenMessage | Open Message | And this panel opens when the hero falls.
deselect

chapter: Down the stairs | Walk the crypt, turn by turn
play
wait: 0.8
expectvalue: Crypt.DungeonGenerator.Floor = 1
explain: game | The first floor | The hero starts in the first room, lit by a lantern. Each step is a turn, and the monsters move after it.
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
tap: Up
wait: 0.35
say: Up the corridor. The stairs are in the room the longest walk from the start.
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
tap: Right
wait: 0.35
wait: 0.5
expectvalue: Crypt.DungeonGenerator.Floor = 2
expectvalue: Floor.Text.Value = Floor 2
explain: game | Floor two | Down the stairs, a new floor: a new crypt, new monsters and treasure, and the hero keeps their health and potions.
stop
say: That's the Roguelike template.
